# Only the anonymised samples are tracked. Uploads land on data.csv (app.py),
# so a real attendee export must never be re-includable here.
!*.sample.csv
# The reference label raster, tracked so the exact bitmap under test can be
# printed through another path (P-touch Editor) to isolate printer faults.
!label-test.png
codes/*.png
badges/*.pdf
# Default --dry-run output: regenerable from print_label.py, never edited by hand.
label-instructions.bin

